---
config:
  look: classic
  theme: default
  flowchart:
    curve: basis
    wrappingWidth: 260
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as SSH client (laptop)
    participant S as SSH server (Linux VM, port 22)
    C->>S: initiate connection
    S-->>C: negotiate algorithms, set up an encrypted channel
    S-->>C: host key
    C->>C: verify host key (known_hosts)
    C->>S: authenticate with password or SSH key pair
    S-->>C: access granted, shell opened
    C->>S: commands, SCP / SFTP file transfer
    S-->>C: output
    C->>S: exit
